window.products.push({"id":384030,"name":"Thick Alpaca Wool Blanket Heavyweight Alpaca Wool Blanket Camping Outdoors Indoors Soft Peruvian Alpaca Wool Blankets That Come in Twin Queen King Siz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hn3YF8VfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"COZY COMFORT MEETS ELEGANT DESIGN: From chilly autumn evenings to the dead of winter, staying comfortably warm at night isn’t always easy. Thin blankets made with synthetic materials do little to shield you from the cold, making it impossible to enjoy a restful sleep.  Our alpaca wool blanket solves that problem so you don't ever have to worry about uncomfortable sleep again FEATURES: ✔ King size (110\" x 93\") ✔ Queen size (93\" x 91\") ✔ Twin size (90\" x 60\") ✔ Twin size (Whipstitch trim) (90\" x 58\") ✔ Full range of stunning color combinations ✔ For best results, dry clean only TRY RISK FREE WITH OUR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: Snuggle up with our alpaca wool blanket for comfort you can’t find anywhere else. Luxuriously thick and heavy, our wool blanket  wraps you in a cloak of warmth that effectively blocks out cold. But because it remains breathable, there’s no uncomfortable overheating. Order your wool throw blanket now and wrap yourself in comfort! WHY CHOOSE OUR ALPACA WOOL BLANKET? We offer a full range of stunning color combinations, ensuring there’s a design that suits your taste, lifestyle and décor. Made in Peru and shipped from Florida, we deliver quality right to your front door. Our wool blanket's selected fibers result in a strong, durable fabric you'll love for years to come GIFT OUR ALPACA WOOL BLANKET TO ANY LOVED ONE! Our wool thick blanket is great for sporting events, camping trips and family picnics. It delivers go-anywhere warmth when you need it most. While similar blankets can be stiff and scratchy, ours is incredibly soft and smooth. Our wool blanket will make the perfect gift to anyone, even you! ADD TO CART NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hn3YF8VfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca Warehouse","source_asin":"B071ZWQM9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZWQM9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZWQM9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
