window.products.push({"id":384135,"name":"JSBL CDL 4feet/120cm/4ft/48inch Tall Life-Size Large/Giant Christmas Wooden Nutcracker King & Soldier Ornament/Doll/Figures Events/ShopWindow/Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51axNKlIhnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We have beautiful wooden nutcracker made as King series and Soldier Series. Plenty of designs with 3 sizes in height: 4ft/5ft/6ft for your selection. These are popular used as Christmas gifts for your beloved ones. These decorations create best atmosphereor your home or your commercial places or your important events. For 4feet item list in this page with major specifications: Weight of product: about 10kgs Bottom board size: 20cm by 20cm by 5cm thick Height : about 4 feet They're handmade, each one varies slightly. Color, designs ,weight and size may various between each batch of production. FAQ Q: Can it crack nuts? A: It has a big movable mouth that may be able to cracks nuts. It designed for decoration purpose and has special meanings. When open and close its mouth, his big teeth will open and close also. It shows his strength and power, serves like trusty watch dog guarding your family from evil and danger, protect your family and brings good luck. If you read novel -The Nutcracker and the King of Mice, you will understand nutcracker here is not refer as a usual tool to crack nut. Q: Can these be put outdoors? A: It is made of wood, and painted. The beard and hair is fake fur, so it would get wet. I would not put it outside, because there are wooden surfaces that are not painted.This is good description on the product from customer to answer this question. But to put out door will create best atmosphere. If you cherish it to and wish to keep it for many years to use, move to out door in good sunny weather only. Especially the glitter series is sensitive to wet. Keep away from raining. If you wish to have new ones every year, you do not need care about the wet issue. Present outside during Christmas and throw away when the condition is no longer good. For customer looks for water proof, may need looking for those machine made glass material nutcrackers. What we offer are wooden hand painted nutcrackers here decorated with plenty of not water-proof material.~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51axNKlIhnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSBL","source_asin":"B08F9WNTNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F9WNTNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F9WNTNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
