window.products.push({"id":384257,"name":"Recaceik 3 Pieces, Square Pub Stools, Faux Marble Dining Set of 2, Kitchen Counter Height 2 Chair, Modern Bar Table Set for Living Room, Restaurant, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJ+SNrAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern & Simple Bar Table-3 Pieces Bar Table Set: The exquisite and elegant artificial marble table top and the simple and sturdy metal frame make this bar table set suitable for many occasions and various home decoration styles.The spacious table top and soft chairs allow two people to enjoy food and wine comfortably. This 3 piece bar dinette is suitable for bars, restaurants, and coffee shops. If you take this bar table and chair home, whether it is in the living room, kitchen, dining room, breakfast corner, it is very practical. Super sturdy and stable structure-3-piece bar table set: This 23-inch round bar table set is made of ceramic volcano and a sturdy metal frame, which is durable and has a long service life. The bar counter is made of artificial marble and thick metal to ensure stability and durability. The legs are very stable on the floor and there is no wobble problem at all. The stool has a load-bearing capacity of up to 220 pounds. The table top can hold up to 130 pounds. Bar Lovers optimal choice -3 piece bar table set: Whether you like a drink with friends or a light breakfast before you're on the go, this bar table and chairs set is sure to delight. Elegant brown marble tabletop and composed black tones, creates a it rounds off your leisure or busy times with a cozy, pub-like vibe, decorate your party to make it more exciting and memorable. Space Saver- 3 piece bar table set: This counter height table with compact design is a perfect partner for small spaces. The space-saving design allows you to place this bar dining table and chair anywhere in your home. Whether it is the balcony, kitchen, dining room or corner of your home, this bar set can be perfectly integrated, helping you to create your own unique style of bar.Compared to a large dining table that took up too much room, this bar takes up little space. What You Get-3 piece bar table set: A bar table, 2 bar stools, assembly accessories. This dining room table set has a simple structure. With detailed instructions and numbered parts, This bar table and chair can be assembled in time it can be assembled in the time it takes to make a cup of mojito.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KJ+SNrAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Recaceik","source_asin":"B09PQT586J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PQT586J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PQT586J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":384258,"name":"NAZAKOOL Toothbrush Razor Holder Wall Mounted for bathrooms Tooth Brushing Adhesive -Save Space Easy to Drain - Easy to Clean 100% Wooden Save The Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718y0IzM1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wooden furniture has been a popular choice for centuries due to its durability, versatility, and natural beauty. When it comes to toothbrush holders for bathrooms, wooden holders offer several advantages over other materials. Here, we will discuss the benefits of using wooden toothbrush holders in your bathroom. Firstly, wooden toothbrush holders are incredibly durable and long-lasting. They are designed to withstand wear and tear, making them an excellent investment for your bathroom. Unlike plastic holders that can crack or break easily, wooden holders can withstand regular use and last for many years. This means you can enjoy a well-organized bathroom without having to worry about replacing your toothbrush holder frequently. Secondly, wooden toothbrush holders are versatile and can be customized to suit any bathroom decor. They come in a variety of finishes, from natural wood to stained or painted finishes, making it easy to find a toothbrush holder that matches your bathroom style. You can also choose from different types of wood, such as bamboo, oak, or teak, each with its own unique texture and color. Thirdly, wooden toothbrush holders are eco-friendly and sustainable. Wood is a renewable resource that can be harvested sustainably, making it an excellent choice for those who want to reduce their environmental footprint. Additionally, wooden toothbrush holders are biodegradable, which means they will not contribute to landfills or harm the environment when disposed of properly. Fourthly, wooden toothbrush holders are easy to clean and maintain. They can be wiped down with a damp cloth and mild soap to keep them looking new. Unlike plastic holders, wooden holders do not absorb bacteria, making them a hygienic option for your bathroom. Finally, wooden toothbrush holders are a great way to add warmth and texture to your bathroom. They provide a natural and inviting feel that is hard to replicate with other materials. Additionally, wooden toothbrush holders can be combined with other wooden accessories, such as soap dishes or towel racks, to create a cohesive and stylish look. In conclusion, wooden toothbrush holders offer several advantages over other materials. They are durable, versatile, eco-friendly, easy to clean, and add warmth and texture to your bathroom. Whether you prefer a natural wood finish or a painted finish, there is a wooden toothbrush holder out there for you. By choosing a wooden toothbrush holder, you can enjoy a well-organized and stylish bathroom that is both functional and beautiful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718y0IzM1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAZAKOOL","source_asin":"B0BZN8LD79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZN8LD79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZN8LD79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
