window.products.push({"id":384439,"name":"RSVP Endurance Julienne Peeler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y6oUGAr-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Precision RSVP stainless-steel peelers with extra-sharp blades make prep even easier. Soft-grip handles take the pressure off hands to zest, peel or julienne effortlessly. With quick even strokes, this fruit zester and peeler shaves only the citrus rind, leaving behind the white bitter pith that can alter taste and texture of recipes. Works efficiently to peel thin strips from fruits and vegetables. The large perforation referred to as a channel, features U-shaped edge to create decorative garnishes and channel cuts for appealing appetizers, salad or casserole toppings. Dishwasher-safe Extra-wide fruit and vegetable peeler and shredder shaves quickly, producing uniform wide strips from cucumbers, zucchini or squash. This stainless-steel peeler with precision-sharp serrations peels thick rind on root vegetables, such as carrots, beets, jicama or turnips. Slices potatoes thinly for au gratins. The 3 1/4\" wide blade shreds large amounts of cabbage or cheese, or potatoes for hash browns. Efficiently shaves mango or papaya for salads or chocolate for desserts. Dishwasher-safe. Julienne peeler is the superior performance tool to create uniform matchstick strips for stir fry in less time, with less effort. Soft-grip handle allows quick even strokes, without hand strain. Easily julienne carrots, celery, peppers or onions, squash or zucchini. Excellent to prepare vegetables strips for salads or add citrus flavoring to desserts. Shave ginger root for Asian recipes. Dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y6oUGAr-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RSVP","source_asin":"B007SPKJY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007SPKJY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007SPKJY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
