window.products.push({"id":384458,"name":"Victorinox 24-Piece Gourmet Cutlery Set with Attache Case, Rosewood Handles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xBboIeuFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description A TRUSTED FAVORITE Designed for professionals, this Victorinox Rosewood Gourmet Cutlery Set truly has it all. Equipped with 24 tools and knives that handle nearly every ask imaginable. Crafted with comfortable handles, superior weight and balance, a durable travel case, and razor sharp knives that rarely require re-sharpening . KEY FEATURES High-quality, lightweight European steel. High-quality, lightweight European steel. Handle designs reduce hand and wrist fatigue. Handle designs reduce hand and wrist fatigue. 24-piece set fit for all kitchen tasks. 24-piece set fit for all kitchen tasks. Hard black case with latches and handles. Hard black case with latches and handles. Hand polished rosewood handles for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Hand polished rosewood handles for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Dishwasher safe. Dishwasher safe. CARE AND USE Be good to your knives and they’ll be good to you. Following these simple guidelines will ensure that you get the longest life out of your knife! CLEANING Victorinox Swiss Army recommends washing all knives by hand. For best results, hand wash your knives with a soapy cloth and dry immediately.  While Fibrox Pro knives are dishwasher safe, we recommend hand washing as dishwashers are designed to spray water at a relatively high pressure, which can jostle the silverware and cause the knives to collide, dulling the edge. SHARPENING For optimum performance, knives should be honed after every couple of uses. Proper and frequent use of a honing steel will keep your knives sharper and performing at their best. FORMERLY FORSCHNER In 1937 Victorinox began selling cutlery in America through a Connecticut distributor called R.H. Forschner & Co. A well-known manufacturer of butcher scales, Forschner soon became the exclusive U.S. distributor for Victorinox knives, and was the name by which Victorinox knives were known. Amazon.com Designed for the professional chef, this superb set of 23 different types of R.H. Forschner by Victorinox knives and utensils comes in a sturdy black attaché case with secure latches and a carry handle. The set includes the following knives: paring; shaping; bread; small chef's; large chef's; butcher; boning; flexible filet; kullenschiff slicer. The other tools consist of: spatula; oyster knife; apple corer, potato peeler; lemon peeler; lemon zester; double melon baller; sharpening steel; carving fork; larding and tying needles; 10 assorted icing funnels; 10 assorted icing decorators; forged decorating knife; stainless-steel shears. The knife blades are made-finished in Switzerland of high-carbon, no-stain steel with tapered, ground edges, and the handles are made of rosewood in traditional, three-rivet styling. R.H. Forschner by Victorinox has long been a favorite cutlery company in commercial kitchens where sharpness and durability are crucial. Lightweight yet balanced to reduce tiring over extended use, the knives retain their sharp edges and are readily resharpened when necessary. Forschner recommends washing the knives by hand even though they're dishwasher-safe, and covers the set with a lifetime warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 24-piece culinary set. The set includes: paring knife; shaping knife; bread knife; small chef's knife; large chef's knife; butcher knife; boning knife; flexible filet knife; kullenschiff slicer; spatula; oyster knife; apple corer, potato peeler; lemon peeler; lemon zester; double melon baller; sharpening steel; carving fork; larding and tying needles; 10 assorted icing funnels; 10 assorted icing decorators; forged decorating knife; stainless-steel shears; hard attaché case. 25 items total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xBboIeuFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B000GX7KLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GX7KLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GX7KLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":384459,"name":"Urn Ring Cremation Jewelry for Ashes - 925 Sterling Silver Infinity Heart Memorial Souvenir Keepsake Ring Hold Loved Ones Ashes for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sJqaniIZL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"This Irish and Celtic inspired spin on our Caged Hearts Ring is full of meaning and love! The three-dimensional heart features Celtic detailing and heart-shaped, It's the perfect representation of you and your loved ones being safe and protected with love for each other.This Nobility cremation ring is a beautiful and loving way to remember someone in your life that is no longer there. Material: This ring is formed from solid 925 sterling silver - crafted and polished finish by hand. An Eternal knot Express thoughts for loved ones.screw a tight seal to keep your urn ashes. Ring size:7.5.The ring is entirely made from high quality 925 silver and is hypoallergenic. It is also an excellent gift for a woman with sensitive skin. Our sweet celtic Heart cremation jewelry ring is packed in a beautiful gift box with a silver cloth and funnel filler kit.Holds a small memorial of your loved one. The urn ring features a secure threaded enclosure to store ashes, dried flowers, the lock of hair or sand from a favorite beach to make a personal memorial for your loved one. 100% GUARANTEED MONEY BACK IF NOT SATISFIED：Apotie only use the high quality material, we stand behind our products. If you are not satisfied, just contact us at any time, we will assist you to find a solution promptly. Our aim is to be original, inspiring and meaningful","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sJqaniIZL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"APOTIE","source_asin":"B08CH9TWHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CH9TWHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CH9TWHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
