window.products.push({"id":384587,"name":"Arkwright Herringbone Kitchen Tea Towels - (Pack of 24) 100 Percent Cotton Dishcloth, Absorbent, Quick Dry Dish Drying Towel, 15 x 25 in, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f5NEgZCbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE BEST HERRINGBONE KITCHEN TOWELS: Tough weave meets soft cotton with these 15” x 25” premium cotton absorbent, quick-drying, and stylish cleaning towels. Arkwright herringbone kitchen towels are as terrific for the home kitchen as they are in commercial kitchens. Some restaurants use herringbone kitchen towels as rustic bistro napkins. Absorbent, quick-drying, and stylish. KITCHEN TOWEL VALUE PACK: These large economical flat woven 15\" x25\" tea towels come in a bulk case pack of 288 cleaning cloths. Use them multiple times between washings. Keep extra fresh tea towels in your linen cupboard and say goodbye to disposable paper towels. THE MULTICOLORED, MULTIFACETED KITCHEN TOWEL: The herringbone weave design of our dishtowel is distinctively elevated by the color center stripe. Our kitchen hand towels feel classic and add a touch of elegance to any home, hotel, bar, restaurant, cafe, bed and breakfast, airbnb etc. LIGHTWEIGHT AND QUICK DRYING: The flat weave nature of herringbone towels make our kitchen hand towels lightweight, absorbent and quick-drying. They leave a lint-free, streak-free, and smooth finish when drying dishes, glasses, utensils or when cleaning countertops, tabletops, bars etc. MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash on regular cycle, do not use bleach or harsh chemicals. Tumble Dry low. They can be washed and reused many times without losing their absorbency or softness. After many, many uses, repurpose our kitchen towels as cleaning towels and rags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f5NEgZCbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arkwright LLC","source_asin":"B08WCTBJ9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WCTBJ9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WCTBJ9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
