window.products.push({"id":384625,"name":"(Straw Lid x 2) Straw Lid for Insulated Water Bottles Compatible with Hydro Flask Standard. Replacement Sport Flip Top for 1.91 Double Walled Thermo M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71swgjQ1eWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The straw lid perfectly fits Involve & Evolve 12oz, 17oz, 20oz and 25oz insulated water bottles. The lid is also compatible with most standard mouth double walled water bottles like Hydro Flask Standard Mouth or Simple Modern Ascent (1.91\"/48mm diameter measured from the outside of the flask opening). However, it's NOT COMPATIBLE WITH COLA SHAPE bottle. Sets content: Straw Lid x 1 - 1 straw lid and 2 straws. Straw Lid x 2 - 2 straw lids and 2 strawsThe straws are 8 1/2 inches long. The length can be easily adjusted with scissors.The newly designed Flip & Sip cap has a high flow rate, you can drink from it at any angle and it accommodates one hand drinking. You can easily flip the spout up and enjoy your drink. The lid has also a comfortable finger loop with a smooth silicone pad on the handle that allows for easy carrying.Straw lids and straws are made of premium quality BPA free plastic, non toxic components that are safe for kids. The lids are dishwasher safe and can be easily cleaned with a straw brush. Through Involve & Evolve project we want to encourage you to minimize single use consumption. Do you know that single use packaging accounts for 40% of all waste, used just once and then discarded?! Feel proud that by refilling your bottle, you are at the same time reducing plastic consumption, so please carry your reusable bottle with you and refill it with your favorite beverage. You know that you will be making a big difference :)If you are looking for a reusable water bottle, please check our other listings. We offer a wide range of vacuum insulated water bottles in various designs and sizes.If you have any questions or concerns please contact us via FB. 100% customer satisfaction and making the world a better place in an eco friendly way is our true calling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71swgjQ1eWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Involve & Evolve","source_asin":"B07ZXWRBNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZXWRBNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZXWRBNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
