window.products.push({"id":384659,"name":"ProLounger RCL89-SM SmartHome Recliner, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NQas9D9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ProLounger power smart recliner is equipped with everything you need for reading, web browsing, working or relaxing. The comfortable recliner is covered in a Caribbean Blue linen-like fabric and provides padding in all the right places for ultimate comfort. This smart recliner is Wi-Fi enabled and can be operated by voice command via Alexa, an app for your smart device or an electric control panel on the recliner which will allow you to recline, return to a stationary position, adjust the head rest and control lumbar support. This loaded recliner also includes a storage compartment in each arm, a convenient USB port for charging electronic devices on the power control bar, A cup holder, a reading light and a holder for a phone or tablet. Perfect for living rooms, bedrooms, theater rooms and media rooms. Covered in a durable, easy clean 100% polyester linen-like Caribbean Blue fabric. Styled with a modern profile which features squared pillow top arms and a squared back. Full chaise pad between the chair and the leg rest to support the legs for a truly comfortable recline. Usb port allows you to charge your devices close at hand. Goose neck reading light at the top left of the recliner is touch activated and controlled. Power controller is conveniently located on the inside Arm of the chair. Recliner is 65. 75 inches fully reclined, 42. 25 inches from the back of the seat to the footrest, 23. 5 inches from the seat to the top of the recliner. Recliner requires 5 inches in back to recline and 23. 5 inches in front to recline. Cushions are filled with high density foam, polyester fiber and independently wrapped pocket Coil spring system for a custom sit. Constructed with a laminated hardwood and metal frame. Sturdy sinuous spring seating. Steel reclining mechanism. Insulated spring clips for noise reduction. Seats up to 300 lbs. Ships in one (1) box. No tool assembly in less than 25 minutes with included instructions. Usb output 5 volts DC. Total charging capability 2. 1 Amps. Ul approved power cord. Quick start guide for Alexa voice control. Alexa not included. Imported. Color may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NQas9D9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProLounger","source_asin":"B07WRS22DL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WRS22DL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WRS22DL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
