window.products.push({"id":384778,"name":"BevGoods Cotton Flour Sack Kitchen Towels - Set of 2 Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SwizX0mGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flour sack towels have a rich American history. In the early 1900s, when times were hard, flour sacks became just as valuable to families as the goods they held. Thrifty housewives would wash, bleach and sew pillowcases, dresses and kitchens towels from these bags and then pass the tradition down from mother to daughter. Our silkscreened flour sack dish towels are just like what Grandma used, updated with a modern design that reflects its tradition. Made from 100% cotton our flour sack towels are processed in small batches and as a result, towels may vary slightly in size, color and texture, giving you a beautifully unique product. Made with an extra thick, authentic flour sack weave these towels are heavy, durable, smooth and super absorbent. Use them for a decorative touch, wrapping up warm bread, cleaning, drying or polishing and baking without lint, scratches or streaks. 100% Cotton Bright White Towels Authentic Flour Sack Weave Hemmed on all four sides Approx. 16”x24\" Durable and soft Ideal for kitchen and household cleaning Use less paper towels! These absorbent kitchen towels are great for wiping away water on the counter and drying dishes Get a pack for yourself and one for a gift today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SwizX0mGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BevGoods","source_asin":"B06ZZZPSQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZZPSQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZZPSQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
