window.products.push({"id":384827,"name":"Silicone Stretch Lids Set of 12, Reusable Durable Food Storage Bowl Covers Fit Different sizes Transparent & Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUtsdHPrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Silicone Stretch Lids Set of 12,Reusable Durable Food Storage Bowl Covers Fit Different sizes Transparent & Blue. Reasons for choose our products. 1. This food storage bag is made of food grade PEVA material and is PVC free, lead free, chlorine free and BPA free. 2. The zipper lock container is designed to retain odors and liquids for a long time while keeping food fresh and easy to carry. 3. From low temperature -40 ℃ to high temperature 230 ℃, it can be frozen or boiled liquid. It can be used for refrigeration in the refrigerator and for heating in the oven or microwave. 4. Various sizes can be stored. It can store not only food storage bags, but also pet supplies, travel supplies, toiletries, soaps, cosmetics, etc. 5. Reusable and can be stored in the kitchen or cabinet. If you do, it will last a long time. Attention 1. Avoid using it by exposing it directly to a fire or heat source. 2. When using the dishwasher, please refrain from using abrasives. 3. When using, first wipe the lid and tableware with water to improve airtightness. 4. Since each tableware has a different shape, water leakage does not occur, so please refrain from turning it upside down. 5. When heating liquids such as soups and drinks, hot water vapor may accumulate due to airtightness, so be careful when opening. 6. Remove the slide bar of the food storage bag before heating. The slide bar cannot be used in the microwave. 7. When using the silicone storage bag in the microwave or oven, do not completely seal the container. Easy to operate. Use as shown and easy to open and close It can be used directly for contact with food and storage. We are committed to quality and reliability. 100% reliability guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUtsdHPrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nother","source_asin":"B08RB5N7Z2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RB5N7Z2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RB5N7Z2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
