window.products.push({"id":384915,"name":"Bright Zeal 12\" Bottle Lights with Cork & LED String Lights with Timer (Gold Mercury Glass, 6Hr Timer) - Decorative Bottles For Kitchen Lighted Wine B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Un+D29tVL._AC_.jpg","description":"FAIRY BORDEAUX GLASS BOTTLE LIGHT 1. 12\" tall gold mercury glass wine bottle makes a dazzling centerpiece or tabletop display.2. 10 LED bulbs on the silver string glow: pinpoints of light emerge like twinkling stars suspended in mid-air, bringing a touch of magic to any setting; mesmerized by the wonderland scene released by its celestial, starburst glow.3. Based on timeless elegance of Bordeaux bottles, the radiant bottle elevates the style of any home decor. LED VINTAGE GLASS BOTTLE WEDDING DECOR 1. The gold mercury glass bottle with cork makes a great addition to centerpiece and table decor for vintage and shabby chic themed weddings.2. You can add personalised writing, the name of the person you love and pictures on the bottle, providing you with a sweet experience to evoke deep, layered memories.3. Particularly striking when grouped with other bottle lights. 6 HR TIMER & EASY DECORATING 1. 6 HR TIMER: Can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically. Let time be your convenience.2. Battery powered: each requires 2 x AA batteries (INCLUDED) & Allow to create a fairy effect indoors and outdoors, even in the shade (unlike solar versions that must be placed in full sun).3. Comes in a gift box, ready for gift giving to friends, relatives and loved ones. FAQs 1. Battery case and ON/TIMER/OFF switch are at the bottom of bottle.2. This light is not a fully waterproof one, to maintain the long life span, you shall keep it from rain or damp environment. ATTENTION 1. Remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time.2. Please handle this product with care to avoid breaking down.3. It is advisable to be kept away from naked flames, liquids and little hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Un+D29tVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B01G8KACNU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-384915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G8KACNU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G8KACNU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
